## 🔑 Auth Watch — lives in the weekly job

The credential-expiry check lives in the **weekly** transactions job (`recurring/daily-transactions.md` → "Weekly Auth Watch"). Auth monitoring must stay weekly: at this job's monthly cadence a dead credential could sit ~4 weeks before alerting. Nothing to run in this job.

