## 🚀 Delivery

Write the report to `briefs_financial/monthly-YYYY-MM-DD.md`, then deliver:

```bash
python3 {{MINERU_HOME}}/scripts/deliver-output.py \
  {{MINERU_HOME}}/briefs_financial/monthly-YYYY-MM-DD.md \
  --imessage-keychain <second-recipient-keychain-service> \
  --imessage-format monthly_finance
```

The `--imessage-*` pair is the **optional second-recipient arm**: it sends a reformatted iMessage copy to a household member who doesn't use Telegram. `--imessage-keychain` reads their number from a Keychain service you name (kept out of git); `--imessage-format monthly_finance` selects the "airy" financial treatment (strips `#` headers, inserts `┄` section dividers, keeps each line's existing emoji — see `lib/imessage_format.py`). The arm is non-fatal — a failure there never blocks the Telegram delivery. Drop both flags if the install has no second recipient. See `recurring/README.md` — delivery contract.

